{
    "info": {
        "_postman_id": "7c2f9c40-1c2a-4d3e-9f10-stepupcrm0001",
        "name": "StepUpCRM API v1",
        "description": "StepUpCRM REST API (`/v1/*`).\n\nOne route file feeds the `/v1` mount:\n- `routes/admin-v1.php` — staff API (`/v1/admin/*`), plus the shared `/v1/profile` and `/v1/notifications`.\n\nThere is no `/api/*` prefix and no `/v2`.\n\n## Setup\n1. Import `stepupcrm-api.postman_environment.json` and select it.\n2. Set `base_url` (default `https://llb.test`).\n3. Run **Auth → Staff login** — the test script stores `{{token}}` automatically.\nCollection auth is Bearer `{{token}}`.\n\n## Notes\n- Every request sends `Accept: application/json`.\n- List endpoints accept `search`, `page`, `per_page` (max 100), `sort`, `direction` (`asc`/`desc`). They are added as disabled query params — tick them in Postman to use them.\n- Endpoints that accept a file (user image, profile image) use `multipart/form-data`. Updates with a file are sent as `POST` with `_method=put|patch`, which is what the React forms do.",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [
            {
                "key": "token",
                "value": "{{token}}",
                "type": "string"
            }
        ]
    },
    "variable": [
        {
            "key": "base_url",
            "value": "https://llb.test"
        },
        {
            "key": "token",
            "value": ""
        },
        {
            "key": "user_id",
            "value": "1"
        },
        {
            "key": "role_id",
            "value": "1"
        },
        {
            "key": "activity_log_id",
            "value": "1"
        },
        {
            "key": "notification_id",
            "value": ""
        }
    ],
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "Auth",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Staff login",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "const body = pm.response.json();",
                                    "const token = body.result?.token;",
                                    "pm.test('login returns a token', () => pm.expect(token).to.be.a('string'));",
                                    "if (token) {",
                                    "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', token);",
                                    "}"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "noauth"
                        },
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password\"\n}",
                            "options": {
                                "raw": {
                                    "language": "json"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/login",
                        "description": "Sanctum bearer token issue. Stores `{{token}}` from the response."
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "Me",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
